@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_21_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛马上跟在希罗身后，来到过道上。|#0101Adv03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等我一下，希罗！|#0101Adv03_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过道上又出现了<br>许多名少女。|#0101Adv03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们的视线都集中在了艾玛身上。<br>除了希罗，艾玛并未见过这些少女。|#0101Adv03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（太好了……我还在想，<br>　要是全部人都是初中的同学，我该怎么办呢……）|#0101Adv03_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但，所有人的年纪看起来都和自己差不多。<br>跟艾玛和希罗一样，她们都身穿奇妙的衣裳。|#0101Adv03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而过道前方，一个黑衣异形正在走动着。|#0101Adv03_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那个异形就是所谓的看守吧）|#0101Adv03_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他少女也吓得脸色煞白，不知所措，<br>只好跟随看守开始移动。|#0101Adv03_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗远远走在了艾玛前边。<br>艾玛小跑着追赶着她。|#0101Adv03_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗！|#0101Adv03_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0101Adv03_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听、听我说。虽然发生了这样那样的事，<br>不过还能见到希罗你，真是太好了。|#0101Adv03_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经下决心改变了，<br>已经不是过去的我了。<br>我想和你做朋友。|#0101Adv03_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0101Adv03_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗似乎决意要无视艾玛，<br>没有放慢脚步。|#0101Adv03_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我，我不会放弃的！|#0101Adv03_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆忌々しそうに息を詰める

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0101Adv03_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗发出咬牙切齿的声音，<br>转过身来面向艾玛。|#0101Adv03_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，毫不犹豫地推了艾玛一下。|#0101Adv03_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呀！|#0101Adv03_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

