; [sfx 6：転ぶ音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_6 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@HideActors ActorIds:Ema Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛当即摔倒在地，<br>膝盖擦在坚硬的石地板上。|#0101Adv03_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:而动手伤人的希罗<br>正恶狠狠地俯视着艾玛。|#0101Adv03_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你改变了，<br>跟我有什么关系？|#0101Adv03_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我讨厌你的事实不会改变。<br>永远不会。|#0101Adv03_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗凶巴巴地说道，<br>然后转身离去。|#0101Adv03_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等下……！|#0101Adv03_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmL4,ArmR2

